    tf: ["Hiding sin is the best way to overcome it.", false, "Concealment gives sin power; confession brings mercy and healing."],
    sa: ["Why is accountability helpful in overcoming temptation?", ["secrecy", "light", "confession", "prayer", "friends", "grace"], "A good answer says secrecy strengthens sin, while confession to God and trusted friends brings light, prayer, support and healing, with grace and confidentiality."],
